            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For more localized "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000010"
              ],
              "text": "travel within the governorate"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", a network of buses, service taxis (locally referred to as “servees”), and pick-up taxis provides efficient connections between towns and villages. These modes of transport are not just practical but also offer a closer look at the everyday life of the local population. They are perfect for those wishing to venture to less-traveled "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000013"
              ],
              "text": "destinations or for short-distance journeys"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " within the region."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
