          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "It’s important for travelers to be aware of the security measures in place in "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000018"
              ],
              "text": "Beni Suef"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Depending on the situation, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001b"
              ],
              "text": "local authorities might impose restrictions on access"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " to certain areas, especially for foreign visitors. In some cases, journeys may be accompanied by armed police escorts as a safety precaution. While these security protocols can lead to occasional delays, especially at checkpoints where escorts might change, they are essential for ensuring the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001e"
              ],
              "text": "safety of all travelers"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
